From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Giuseppe Maggio <jertlok@proton.me>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 17:09:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: msm8998: fix the PLL override for the 8th
 CPU corner

The vendor OSM tables give 0x03220022 as the PLL override for the eighth
virtual corner on both clusters -- 806.4 MHz on gold, 825.6 MHz on silver.
Both entries were transcribed with the high half as 0x0320, which programs
the wrong droop-detector level for that corner while every other row in
both tables is byte-exact against the vendor data.

Fixes: c5d7d4dd8420 ("arm64: dts: qcom: msm8998: add CPRh and cpufreq-hw nodes")
Signed-off-by: Giuseppe Maggio <jertlok@proton.me>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8998.dtsi | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8998.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8998.dtsi
index 453443bed9f8..24ef7f78c911 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8998.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8998.dtsi
@@ -503,7 +503,7 @@ opp-902400000 {
 		opp-806400000 {
 			opp-hz = /bits/ 64 <806400000>;
 			required-opps = <&cprh_opp8>;
-			qcom,pll-override = <0x3200022>;
+			qcom,pll-override = <0x3220022>;
 			qcom,pll-div = <1>;
 			qcom,spare-data = <1>;
 		};
@@ -648,7 +648,7 @@ opp-883200000 {
 		opp-825600000 {
 			opp-hz = /bits/ 64 <825600000>;
 			required-opps = <&cprh_opp8>;
-			qcom,pll-override = <0x3200022>;
+			qcom,pll-override = <0x3220022>;
 			qcom,spare-data = <1>;
 		};
 		opp-748800000 {
